<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Norwich Union.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Norwich Union.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group Norwich Union Plc was raised to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>Shares in the former mutually-owned company, which joined the UK equity market on June 16 after an offer to institutional investors priced at 290p per share, were up 2p at 324 by 1036 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 17 1542 4367</p>
</text>
